    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 'find a path' maze books, Amazeballs! presents  100 preset maze levels and infinite randomly generated mazes of user-defined size.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the ball, tracing a path through increasingly difficult top down 2D mazes. Play as one of fifteen ball styles, optionally leaving behind a trail of breadcrumbs to show where you've already been.\u00a0 Relax and enjoy the soothing mental exercise of finding the patterns in the maze, competing only against yourself.\u00a0Choose a maze style that works best for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Time your runs, or opt for completely zen maze running.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A perfect game for giving your mind a break from the world, even if only for a few minutes at a time.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 'find a path' maze books, Amazeballs! presents  100 preset maze levels and infinite randomly generated mazes of user-defined size.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the ball, tracing a path through increasingly difficult top down 2D mazes. Play as one of fifteen ball styles, optionally leaving behind a trail of breadcrumbs to show where you've already been.\u00a0 Relax and enjoy the soothing mental exercise of finding the patterns in the maze, competing only against yourself.\u00a0Choose a maze style that works best for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Time your runs, or opt for completely zen maze running.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A perfect game for giving your mind a break from the world, even if only for a few minutes at a time.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Amazeballs! is a calm, top-down 2D maze pathfinding game for people who enjoy relaxing with patterns and movement. Relax and enjoy the soothing mental exercise of finding the patterns in the maze, competing only against yourself.\u00a0",
